1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,802
For years, he served the emperor
in his palace in Addis Ababa.

2
00:00:04,802 --> 00:00:07,500
They called him the honey wine server.

3
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:14,130
He knew how to pour without
spilling a single drop.

4
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:20,214
And he knew how to disappear
quietly into the room.

5
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:28,971
One night, at a formal gathering,
guests filled the long tables.

6
00:00:29,983 --> 00:00:34,161
A guest asked whether the
emperor even knew his name.

7
00:00:35,983 --> 00:00:39,275
He lowered his eyes in silence,
and said nothing.

8
00:00:42,983 --> 00:00:46,990
The great emperor set down his
glass and asked for his name.

9
00:00:49,983 --> 00:00:57,799
Hearing Tesfaye, he raised a toast,
and the whole hall lifted their glasses.

10
00:00:58,817 --> 00:01:04,902
My grandmother said he spent
his life serving the emperor.

11
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:13,072
But that night, for one moment, the whole
room remembered the man behind the tray.

